  ('Bare Anatomy Ultra Smoothing Shampoo for Dry & Frizzy Hair | 100 ml', 'beauty-personal-care', 'haircare', 'shampoo', 'Bare Anatomy', 265, 249, 25, '- Powered by QT Charge Technology with Carbohydrate Complex and Niacinamide — delivers 37% more smoothness, seals the
