- ["Bare Anatomy Ultra Smoothing Shampoo is powered by QT Charge Technology \u2014 a scientifically advanced formulation system that delivers 37% more smoothness compared to ordinary shampoos. It is designed specifically for dry and frizzy hair that lacks moisture and manageable texture.", "The shampoo is enriched with Carbohydrate Complex, a key active that coats each hair strand with a protective layer, sealing the cuticle to prevent frizz, improve elasticity, and restore the natural smooth texture of hair from the first wash.", "Niacinamide \u2014 a proven skin-and-scalp active \u2014 works by balancing scalp moisture and improving the barrier function. It strengthens the scalp''s natural defence, reducing transepidermal moisture loss and creating a healthier foundation for hair growth.", "Together, Carbohydrate Complex and Niacinamide target the root cause of frizz and dryness: compromised hair cuticles and an imbalanced scalp. The dual-action formula addresses both the scalp and the length of the hair for complete hair health.", "The shampoo deeply hydrates hair strands, replenishing lost moisture caused by heat styling, environmental aggressors such as UV rays, pollutants, salt water, and chlori
  ne. It restores the natural moisture balance of the hair without making it limp or greasy.", "Formulated to leave hair feeling soft, smooth, and healthy-looking after every wash. The lightweight formula cleanses the scalp and hair without stripping essential oils, making it suitable for regular use including daily washing.", "Sulphate-free and paraben-free formula ensures the scalp is not stripped of its natural oils during every wash. The absence of harsh sulphates means the shampoo gently cleanses while maintaining scalp health over time.", "Dermatologically tested and free from toxins \u2014 including parabens, sulphates, and phthalates \u2014 making it safe for all hair types including colour-treated hair, chemically processed hair, and sensitive scalps.", "Cruelty-free and vegetarian formulation developed ethically using plant-derived and scientifically validated ingredients. Bare Anatomy is committed to clean beauty that does not compromise on safety or performance.", "Formulated after 3 years of extensive research by Bare Anatomy EXPERT, backed by over 1 million unique formulations and more than 10 million real consumer insights gathered from Indian hair care concerns and lifestyle factors."]
