- ["BARE Anatomy NatureXScience Rosemary & Coconut Milk Hydrating Shampoo is part of the NatureXScience range \u2014 a collection that bridges the power of natural botanical ingredients with clinically validated science to deliver superior hair care results.", "Rosemary is one of nature''s most celebrated hair-care ingredients. It improves scalp circulation, stimulates hair follicles, and is known to support hair strength and growth. Its antimicrobial properties keep the scalp clean and free from build-up.", "Coconut Milk is rich in essential vitamins, fatty acids, and proteins that penetrate the hair shaft to deliver deep hydration and nourishment. It softens rough, dry strands, reduces breakage, and adds a natural lustre to the hair.", "Together, Rosemary and Coconut Milk form a powerful botanical duo that addresses dry hair from two directions: Rosemary revitalises the scalp and follicles, while Coconut Milk nourishes and hydrates the hair shaft from within.", "The hydrating formula is designed for hair that feels rough, brittle, or persistently dry due to moisture loss caused by he
