  ('Bare Anatomy Expert Anti-Dandruff Shampoo | Up to 100% Dandruff Reduction | Targets Oily Scalp and Sheds Dry Flakes | 100 ml', 'beauty-personal-care', 'haircare', 'shampoo', 'Bare Anatomy', 265, 239, 25, '- Powered by Bare Flake Reduction Technology — targets up to 100% dandruff reduction on both oily and dry scalps simultaneously.
