- Bare Anatomy Expert Anti-Dandruff Shampoo (100 ml) uses Bare Flake Reduction Technology to target up to 100% dandruff reduction on both oily and dry scalp ty
  pes. It hydrates and strengthens the scalp barrier, reduces persistent itchiness and irritation, and strengthens hair weakened by chronic dandruff conditions.
- ["Bare Anatomy Expert Anti-Dandruff Shampoo is enriched with Bare Flake Reduction Technology \u2014 a dual-action formula that simultaneously targets oily scalp dandruff and dry flakes, delivering up to 100% dandruff reduction with regular use.", "Unlike conventional anti-dandruff shampoos that address only one type of scalp condition, this shampoo is clinically designed to work on both oily scalp dandruff (yellow, greasy flakes) and dry scalp dandruff (white, powdery flakes) for comprehensive scalp care.", "The active ingredients work at the follicle level to eliminate the fungal causes of dandruff while simultaneously hydrating the scalp and strengthening the scalp barrier to prevent recurrence and long-term flaking.", "The shampoo hydrates the scalp during every wash, restoring moisture balance that is often disrupted by dandruff-related inflammation. This helps reduce the persistent dryness and tightness that typically accompanies dandruff conditions.", "Formulated to reduce itchiness and irritation \u2014 two of the most disruptive symptoms of dandruff. By addressing scalp inflammation and restoring the moisture ba
  rrier, the shampoo provides relief from discomfort from the very first wash.", "The formula also strengthens hair strands that have been weakened by repeated scalp irritation and scratching. It helps reduce breakage and hair fall that often accompanies chronic dandruff conditions.", "Sulphate-free formulation ensures the scalp is not further irritated or stripped during cleansing. A gentle, effective cleanse removes residue, excess oil, and dandruff flakes without disrupting the scalp''s natural pH balance.", "Paraben-free and free from harsh chemicals \u2014 safe for daily use and suitable for sensitive scalps. The non-irritating formula makes it ideal for those who have struggled with dandruff alongside scalp sensitivity.", "Dermatologically tested and clinically validated for efficacy. Safe for all hair types including oily scalps, dry scalps, and combination scalp conditions. Developed using data from millions of real consumer insights.", "Cruelty-free and vegetarian \u2014 formulated ethically without animal testing or animal-derived ingredients. Part of Bare Anatomy''s commitment to responsible, transparent beauty."]
