  with oily or dry scalp dandruff. Formulated using real consumer insights for Indian scalp conditions.', 'Bare Anatomy Expert Anti-Dandruff Shampoo (100 ml) uses Bare Flake Reduction Technology to target up to 100% dandruff reduction on both oily and dry scalp types. It hydrates and strengthens the scalp barrier, reduces persistent itchiness and irritation, and strengthens hair weakened by chronic dandruff conditions.', 'MKV-0005', 'Onesto Labs Private Limited', 'India', 'Salicylic Acid, Niacinamide', 'Rinse your hair thoroughly with water. Apply a generous amount of shampoo to the scalp and wet hair. Massage gently into the scalp using your fingertips in circular motions. Allow the lather to sit on the scalp for 1-2 minutes for best results. Rinse thoroughly. For best results, use regularly as part of your anti-dandruff hair care routine.', 'For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse immediately with water. Keep out of reach of children. Do not use on sensitive, broken, or irritated skin. Discontinue use if irritation or allergic reaction occurs and consult a dermatologist.', 'India', true, true, 'brand_new', 'bare-anatomy-expert-anti-dandruff-shampoo-up-to-100-dandruff-reduction-targets-oily-scalp-and-sheds-dry-flakes-100-ml'),
