- ["Bare Anatomy EXPERT Oil Control Shampoo is powered by SebumClear Technology \u2014 a targeted formulation that regulates sebum production at the scalp level to reduce excess oil by up to 100% with regular use. It is the first step in achieving a balanced scalp environment.", "Salicylic Acid is the primary active agent for oil and buildup control. As a beta-hydroxy acid, it penetrates the scalp surface to dissolve excess sebum, remove product residue, and unclog hair follicles \u2014 preventing the conditions that lead to oily scalp and greasy roots.", "Hyaluronic Acid addresses a critical challenge of oily scalp care: hydration of the hair lengths. While Salicylic Acid controls oil at the scalp, Hyaluronic Acid binds moisture to the hair shaft, ensuring that lengths remain hydrated and soft \u2014 not dry or brittle.", "Tea Tree Oil provides a natural antimicrobial and anti-inflammatory effect on the scalp. It reduces the microbial activity that contributes to excess sebum production, scalp odour, and irritation, leaving the scalp feeling fresh and balanced.", "The unique formula creates a balanced scalp environment \u2014 reducing itchiness, bu
  ild-up, and excess oil at the roots, while protecting the hydration of the mid-lengths and ends. This makes it uniquely effective for oily scalp with dry ends.", "Clinically proven SebumClear Technology targets the sebaceous glands to normalise oil production without triggering the rebound sebum response that occurs with harsh, drying shampoos. The scalp stays oil-free longer between washes.", "Suitable for men and women with oily scalps. The advanced formula works effectively for all scalp types experiencing excess sebum production due to hormonal changes, diet, climate, or hair product build-up.", "Sulphate-free and paraben-free formula ensures the scalp''s natural pH is not disrupted during cleansing. No harsh detergents mean no rebound oiliness \u2014 just clean, balanced, and healthier-looking hair.", "Dermatologically tested and safe for regular use. Approved for all hair types with an oily scalp, including those with fine or flat hair that is weighed down by excess sebum.", "Cruelty-free and vegetarian. Developed after 3 years of research and over 10 million real consumer insights by Bare Anatomy EXPERT for Indian hair and scalp conditions."]
