- ["Bare Anatomy Curl Defining Shampoo is powered by CL Max Technology \u2014 a formulation designed specifically for curly hair that provides 48-hour curl retention, 2X frizz protection, and a clinically proven 74% improvement in hydration from the very first wash.", "Key active Coconut Oil provides essential nutrition to curly hair, which is naturally prone to dryness due to the coiled structure of the hair shaft that prevents natural oils from travelling down the strand. Coconut oil penetrates the hair shaft to nourish from within.", "Castor Oil locks in the moisture delivered by coconut oil, creating a protective seal on the cuticle. This moisture-lock effect results in dense, manageable, frizz-free, strong, smooth, and shiny curls that maintain their definition throughout the day.", "Hyaluronic Acid hydrates the hair and scalp, drawing moisture from the environment and binding it into the hair shaft. This ensures soft, bouncy curls that are free from the dryness and coarseness that typically causes tangling and breakage.", "The combination of Coconut Oil, Castor Oil, and Hyaluronic Acid directly addresses the core challenges of curly hair: unmanageabili
  ty, dryness, coarseness, tangling, frizz, breakage, and thinning caused by persistent moisture deficiency.", "Clinically tested to improve curl definition and frizz protection. The CL Max formula strengthens the hair by reinforcing the cuticle structure, reducing mechanical damage from detangling, and maintaining the curl''s natural spring and bounce.", "Formulated to produce manageable, smooth, and tangle-free curls after every wash. The shampoo cleanses gently without disrupting the natural curl pattern, preserving the hair''s natural structure and curl memory.", "Sulphate-free and paraben-free formula avoids the harsh cleansing agents that strip curly hair of its essential moisture and disrupt its natural curl pattern. Safe for daily use without causing dry scalp or frizz rebound.", "Phthalate-free and vegan ingredients meet EU standards of safety. Cruelty-free and dermatologically tested \u2014 making it safe for colour-treated curls and sensitive scalps.", "Developed by Bare Anatomy EXPERT after 3 years of research using over 1 million unique formulations and 10 million real consumer insights for Indian curly hair types and tropical climate conditions."]
