  ticle to lock moisture in and shield against humidity, while Hyaluronic Acid hydrates strands — providing up to 24-hour frizz protection for smooth and shiny hair.
- ["Bare Anatomy Anti Frizz Shampoo is powered by Hydrafuse Technology \u2014 an advanced frizz-control system that seals the hair cuticle to lock moisture in and keep humidity out, delivering up to 24 hours of continuous frizz protection from the first wash.", "Key active Fatty Acids form a nourishing yet protective layer on the hair cuticle that repairs and strengthens the hair shaft. This lipid layer smoothens the cuticle surface, improves hair texture, restores natural shine, and prevents frizz caused by rough, raised cuticles.", "Hyaluronic Acid functions as a powerful humectant that retains moisture within the hair strand. By continuously hydrating the hair shaft, it prevents the moisture imbalance that causes hair to absorb atmospheric humidity and swell \u2014 the primary cause of frizz.", "The dual-action of Fatty Acids and Hyaluronic Acid addresses frizz at its source: compromised cuticles that allow moisture to escape and environmental humidity to enter. The sealed, hydrated cuticle prevents frizz from forming throughout the day.", "Hydrafuse Technology also improves hair volume, shine, and overall texture. Hair appears fuller, smoother, and healthier with a visible red
  uction in flyaways and unruly strands that typically accompany frizzy hair conditions.", "Clinically tested to tame frizz and flyaways for up to 24 hours under normal humidity conditions. The frizz protection persists even after styling, making it an essential foundation for any frizz-control hair care routine.", "Formulated for frizzy, damaged, and dull hair types. The shampoo repairs the structural damage that causes frizz \u2014 whether from heat styling, chemical treatments, environmental exposure, or mechanical stress \u2014 restoring smooth and manageable hair.", "Sulphate-free and paraben-free formula ensures the Fatty Acid layer is not stripped from the cuticle during washing. The gentle cleanse removes product residue and scalp build-up without disturbing the protective lipid barrier.", "Dermatologically tested and free from harsh toxins \u2014 safe for regular use on all hair types including colour-treated, chemically processed, and sensitive scalp. Suitable for both women and men.", "Cruelty-free and vegetarian. Formulated after 3 years of extensive research by Bare Anatomy EXPERT using over 1 million unique formulations and real-world data from 10 million consumers."]
