- ["Bare Anatomy Anti-Frizz Leave-In Conditioner is powered by Hydra Fuse Technology \u2014 a deep-conditioning system that works without rinsing to continuously repair and hydrate the hair throughout the day, controlling frizz for up to 24 hours.", "The leave-in conditioner addresses hair damage caused by UV rays, salt and chlorine in water, chemical treatments, excessive heat styling, hot water washing, and environmental humidity. These factors deplete the fatty acid layer from the hair cuticle, causing frizz and dryness.", "Key active Fatty Acids form a nourishing and protective layer on the hair cuticle that repairs the structural damage to the hair shaft. This lipid layer smoothens rough cuticles, improves hair texture, restores shine, and provides lasting frizz protection.", "Hyaluronic Acid is a high-performance humectant that continuously retains moisture within the hair strand throughout the day. By keeping the hair hydrated, it prevents the moisture imbalance that causes frizz when hair absorbs atmospheric humidity.", "As a leave-in formula, the conditioner works continuously after application \u2014 not just during the rinse cycle. This extended conditioning action allows the
  active ingredients to penetrate deeper into the hair shaft and deliver sustained repair and hydration.", "The leave-in conditioner conditions hair thoroughly, making it smoother, shinier, and healthier. Its rich content of essential fats and potassium promotes hair growth, strengthens follicles, and treats dry and flaky scalp conditions.", "Ideal for hair that is consistently dry, frizzy, or dull despite regular conditioning. The leave-in format fills in the moisture gaps between washes, maintaining hair health continuously rather than only during wash sessions.", "Sulphate-free and paraben-free formula that is safe for daily use. Free from toxins including parabens, sulphates, and phthalates \u2014 safe for colour-treated, chemically processed, and sensitive scalp hair types.", "Dermatologically tested and clinically validated. The formula is gentle enough for daily application and effective enough to visibly transform frizzy, unruly hair into smooth, manageable, and shiny hair.", "Cruelty-free and vegetarian formulation by Bare Anatomy EXPERT \u2014 formulated after 3 years of research using over 1 million unique formulations and insights from 10 million real consumers across India."]
