  ed. Suitable for weak, dull, and frizzy hair. Apply on damp hair for all-day conditioning and frizz control.', 'Bare Anatomy Anti-Frizz Leave In Conditioner (150 ml) uses Hydra Fuse Technology with Fatty Acids and Hyaluronic Acid. This no-rinse, leave-in formula repairs the hair cuticle continuously post-wash, controls frizz for up to 24 hours, and leaves hair deeply conditioned, smooth, shiny, and healthy-looking every day.', 'MKV-0009', 'Onesto Labs Private Limited', 'India', 'Fatty Acids, Hyaluronic Acid', 'Take a few pumps of the conditioner in your palm and spread it evenly as per the length of your hair. Apply on damp hair and run it through the middle of your hair, paying particular attention to the ends. Do not rinse. Style as usual. Close the cap to preserve product quality.', 'For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse immediately with water. Keep out of reach of children. Do not use on sensitive, broken, or irritated skin. Discontinue use if irritation or allergic reaction occurs and consult a dermatologist.', 'India', true, true, 'brand_new', 'bare-anatomy-anti-frizz-leave-in-conditioner-deep-conditioned-hair-for-24-hrs-150-ml'),
  ('Bare Anatomy Nature X Science Rose Mary & Coconut Milk Conditioner 150 ml', 'beauty-personal-care', 'haircare', 'conditioner', 'Bare Anatomy', 299, 239, 25, '- BARE Anatomy NatureXScience conditioner with Rosemary and Coconut Milk. Rosemary improves scalp circulation and strengthens follicles, while
  Coconut Milk delivers essential vitamins, fatty acids, and deep hydration to nourish, soften, and restore moisture to dry, rough hair strands.
