  r. Rosemary improves scalp circulation and follicle strength, while Coconut Milk restores moisture, leaving hair softer, smoother, and more manageable.
- ["Bare Anatomy Nature X Science Rose Mary & Coconut Milk Conditioner is part of the NatureXScience range \u2014 a premium line that combines evidence-backed botanical ingredients with advanced hair science to deliver superior conditioning results for dry hair.", "Rosemary is a revered botanical active with proven benefits for scalp health and hair quality. It improves scalp microcirculation, strengthens hair follicles, and provides antioxidant protection against environmental damage \u2014 promoting healthier, stronger hair from the root.", "Coconut Milk is a natural conditioning powerhouse rich in essential vitamins (C, E, B1, B3, B5, B6), minerals, essential fatty acids, and potassium. These nutrients penetrate the hair shaft to deliver deep nourishment, improve elasticity, and restore moisture to dry strands.", "The combination of Rosemary and Coconut Milk delivers a comprehensive conditioning experience: Rosemary revitalises the scalp and strengthens follicles, while Coconut Milk intensely nourishes, hydrates, and softens the hair shaft from cortex to cuticle.", "Formulated specifically for dry hair that lacks hydration, softn
  ess, and manageability. The conditioner replenishes the moisture and nutrients lost through heat styling, sun exposure, pollution, chemical treatments, and over-washing.", "The lightweight formula conditions thoroughly without leaving a heavy or greasy residue. Hair is left feeling soft, smooth, hydrated, and manageable \u2014 not weighed down or coated with product build-up.", "Regular use helps restore the hair''s natural moisture balance, reducing the recurring dryness and roughness that makes hair difficult to style. Hair progressively becomes more manageable and soft with consistent use.", "Sulphate-free and paraben-free formula ensures that the conditioning benefits of Rosemary and Coconut Milk are fully absorbed without disruption from harsh chemicals. Safe for daily or regular use.", "Dermatologically tested and free from toxins including parabens, sulphates, and phthalates. Suitable for all hair types with dryness concerns, including colour-treated and chemically processed hair.", "Cruelty-free and vegetarian \u2014 developed by Bare Anatomy using sustainably sourced botanical ingredients and backed by clinical research."]
