  ir types. Leave-in application not required. Part of the NatureXScience botanical range.', 'Bare Anatomy Nature X Science Rose Mary & Coconut Milk Conditioner (150 ml) combines Rosemary and Coconut Milk to deeply condition and nourish dry hair. Rosemary improves scalp circulation and follicle strength, while Coconut Milk restores moisture, leaving hair softer, smoother, and more manageable.', 'MKV-0010', 'Onesto Labs Private Limited', 'India', 'Rosemary, Coconut Milk', 'Apply conditioner generously to damp hair after shampooing. Work through from mid-lengths to ends. Leave on for 2-3 minutes to allow the formula to penetrate and condition. Rinse thoroughly with cool water. For best results, use regularly after every shampoo.', 'For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse immediately with water. Keep out of reach of children. Do not use on sensitive, broken, or irritated skin. Discontinue use if irritation or allergic reaction occurs and consult a dermatologist.', 'India', true, true, 'brand_new', 'bare-anatomy-nature-x-science-rose-mary-coconut-milk-conditioner-150-ml'),
  ('Bare Anatomy Anti-Dandruff Hair Conditioner with Biotin, Salicylic Acid & Rosemary | Removes Flaky Buildup | Moisturizes & Strengthens Hair | Reduces Frizz & Breakage | For All Hair Types | 175 ml', 'beauty-personal-care', 'haircare', 'conditioner', 'Bare Anatomy', 449, 389, 25, '- Powered by Bare Flake Reduction Technology with Salicylic Acid, Biotin, and Rosemary. Salicylic Acid removes flaky buildup, Biotin stren
