- Bare Anatomy Anti-Dandruff Hair Conditioner (175 ml) is powered by Bare Flake Reduction Technology with Salicylic Acid, Biotin, and Rosemary. It removes flaky
  buildup from hair lengths, strengthens and moisturises damaged strands, and effectively reduces frizz and breakage in one conditioning step for all hair types.
- ["Bare Anatomy Anti-Dandruff Hair Conditioner is powered by Bare Flake Reduction Technology \u2014 a sulphate-free conditioning formula that targets dandruff-related damage at the hair length level, delivering up to 100% flake removal while simultaneously nourishing and strengthening the hair.", "Salicylic Acid lifts stubborn dandruff residue, product build-up, and oily flakes from the hair and scalp surface. Its exfoliating action prevents flake accumulation along the hair lengths, restoring a clean, healthy, and flake-free appearance to the hair.", "Biotin (Vitamin B7) is a critical nutrient for hair structural integrity. It improves the strength and resilience of each hair strand at the protein level, reducing breakage, thinning, and the hair damage that is commonly associated with chronic dandruff conditions.", "Rosemary provides a natural anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial effect that supports the scalp environment during conditioning. It reduces the conditions that allow dandruff to persist, while also improving shine, reducing breakage, and enhancing hair density.", "The three-ingredient complex of Salicylic Acid, Biotin, and Rosemary creates a complete anti-dandruff conditioning solution: Salicylic Acid clean
  ses and removes flakes, Biotin strengthens damaged strands, and Rosemary soothes and restores the scalp.", "Formulated to smooth rough hair lengths that have been damaged by dandruff-related inflammation, scratching, and product residue. The conditioner restores softness, seals split ends, and improves overall hair texture for healthier-looking hair.", "Instantly controls frizz and detangles hair effortlessly, making post-wash styling significantly more manageable. Regular use progressively reduces the frizz and breakage associated with dandruff-weakened hair.", "Locks in moisture and protects the hair from further dandruff-related damage. The moisturising action prevents the recurrence of dryness and brittleness that typically accompanies anti-dandruff treatment routines.", "Sulphate-free formula ensures gentle, effective conditioning without stripping the hair of natural oils or causing scalp irritation. Dermatologically tested and safe for all hair types and daily use after anti-dandruff shampooing.", "100% of users in clinical trials loved the fragrance \u2014 fresh, pleasant, and truly appealing. Cruelty-free and vegetarian formulation. Developed by Bare Anatomy EXPERT for comprehensive anti-dandruff hair care."]
