  evel to restore balance, strengthen the skin barrier, and improve resilience against environmental stressors — ensuring your skin looks healthy, fresh, and youthful throughout the day.", "This Foxtale sunscreen is free from parabens, sulphates, mineral oils, and other harmful additives — ensuring a clean, skin-safe formula that is gentle enough for daily use without causing any adverse reactions.", "Dermatologically tested and clinically validated — Foxtale''s sunscreen is developed with rigorous quality control to ensure every batch meets the highest standards of safety, efficacy, and skin compatibility.", "For best results, use consistently as part of your daily skincare regimen — apply to clean, dry skin and follow with appropriate moisturiser or SPF. Suitable for use morning and/or evening depending on product type.", "Foxtale''s commitment to effective, evidence-based skincare is reflected in every product — combining the best of cosmetic science with skin-friendly ingredients to deliver a premium experience that shows real, measurable results."]', 'FoxTale Niacinamide Dewy Sunscreen SPF 70 Pa++++ - 15 ml is a premium Sunscreen from Foxtale powered by Niacinamide. Designed for All Skin Types, it delivers <p>foxtale niacinamide dewy sunscreen for all skin type spf 70 pa++++ | no white cast | non greasy | anti-tan formula | for spot depigmentation | men & women | 15 ml</p>. Lightweight, non-...', 'MKV-0063', 'Harshvin Kare Products', 'India', '', 'Apply generously to face 15 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every 2 hours. Use as last step in skincare routine.', 'For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse immediately with water. Keep out of reach of children. Do not use on sensitive, broken, or irritated skin. Discontinue use if irritation or allergic reaction occurs and consult a professional.', 'India', true, true, 'brand_new', 'foxtale-niacinamide-dewy-sunscreen-spf-70-pa-15-ml'),
